{"title":"2011 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Four years ago, Daryl was three times as old as Joe was.<br />\nIn five years, Daryl will be twice as old as Joe will be.<br />\nHow old is Daryl now?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> by Daryl's current age and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be Joe's current age. \n</p><p>Since Daryl was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times Joe's age <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> years ago, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/c/98caa495b19cde966efdd07d5d8b9853e627efe0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 4 = 3(y - 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"132\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/0/7e0d8a7973e70a27dc312a7d0020b0604b9c856b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3y - 2 \\times 4 = 3y - 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"192\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Since Daryl will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times Joe's age in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> years, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/2/732f1a14f77fb3f9f02367cada18302591b72c52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 5 = 2(y + 5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"132\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/e/2aeeeaa133ec7244f63cea48abbd5a4b21f9d599.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2y + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/3/a83403eee160c7957c25d9f0e7e3eef86e2053d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3y - 8 = 2y + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"126\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/d/85d5e7e748f42bb9b5062385721ff29450161cfb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3y - 2y = 5 + 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"126\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/7/f0760e265c688498d8376016a70a86c33fc69c8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Plugging this into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/e/2aeeeaa133ec7244f63cea48abbd5a4b21f9d599.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2y + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/5/a85c4b860444ccaef1053e6eb883e377460796ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2 \\times 13 + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"117\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/7/357628579c1035e36d824405e687f5bf7ee7a19b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 26 + 5 = \\boxed{31}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"140\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1.1\">Solution 1.1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1.1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Like solution 1, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/7/f0760e265c688498d8376016a70a86c33fc69c8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/4/8d4c41a6260cb7bc26199395e85437fb68235c1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3y - 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />. Plugging this in, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/4/a74254b1b016cf451751ca44c8a13a05aaf86583.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3 \\times 13 - 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"117\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/d/62d560f61b041f960dbdf20863f340547ec327b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 39 - 8 = \\boxed{31}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"140\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CSMC\" title=\"2011 CSMC\">2011 CSMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CSMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CSMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CSMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CSMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2011 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2011 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2011 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2011 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2011 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CSMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CSMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2011 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Senior_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Senior Competition\">CEMC Senior Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017194820\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 155/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1283/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 134/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3631/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   11.587      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n100.00%   11.587      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37193:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017194820 and revision id 287094. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}